OL,3,GNEWSABroadband fears after fibre works
OL,4,Astop in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a rural Kent village have
OL,7,Fraised concerns they could be left
OL,8,Fwithout broadband access after fibre
OL,9,Finstallation works stopped.
OL,11,FWork began in August in Hunton to
OL,12,Freplace existing copper broadband
OL,13,Finfrastructure with fibre cables, but
OL,14,Fresidents said it stopped after a few
OL,15,Fdays.
OL,17,FSome residents said they had been told
OL,18,Fthey might need to find another
OL,19,Fbroadband provider, but they did not
OL,20,Fknow what was happening.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
