OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABroadband fears after fibre works
OL,4,Astop in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FKings Hill-based firm Trooli said it
OL,7,Fhad not been possible to extend its
OL,8,Ffibre network and affected customers
OL,9,Fhad been contacted. Openreach said the
OL,10,Fold network would close on 31 January
OL,11,F2027 and customers would need to move
OL,12,Fto a digital phone service by then.
